{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\">Problem 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd6ee81a7a535d87853e848c77654cc36104a75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e45ade7444cff58f52568e211370df22d113a12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left|x-\\sqrt{(x-1)^2}\\right|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"123\" height=\"43\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf50ca367f174270a42cd9deaccb02b9a67a7d74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }1-2x\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }-2x-1\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }1+2x\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }2x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"541\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/3/603ec0368b0eabf5d2a2ba280e43d16f0cdd4beb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x^2} = |x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"22\" />, so we rewrite the expression as follows.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e7e72c2db6d3f885a013df9600391c5dc7caf25.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|x - \\sqrt{(x-1)^2}| = |x - |x-1||\\]\" width=\"238\" height=\"32\" />\nWe know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a68e8aa6ec6f48231ad80a4851f84bacf641b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/d/14dd5bcd5d074df8011693f56cd0faa1362fe9bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1 &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, we can rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/5/fb552300afddad49a8b28ca5d50402393a47616d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-1|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"18\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/8/b08aa5a28c62ed05af271aee7e5e053a0d4179b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. So\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/9/999a9fe862cdaebfcc24afb50a94f7939aaee628.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|x - |x-1|| = |x - (1-x)| = |2x - 1|\\]\" width=\"298\" height=\"18\" />.\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/1/1a1c5257309c7dfbcb40e0b3b8ce022d1d1d59eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt; 0, 2x-1 &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />. Thus, we can write this as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/3/1f396534d8475085751482a5528df752e5be0af0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|2x - 1| = 1- 2x\\]\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><br />\n~JustinLee2017\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-brack